scenario: VOICE-WAKE-01
title: Wake phrase (experimental)
area: Voice
rows: F-VOICE-46, F-VOICE-60
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A working microphone. The wake phrase is EXPERIMENTAL and off by default: switch it on in Settings, Voice only for this check.
step: Switch on the wake phrase in Settings, Voice. Read what the page says about it.
expect: The page says in words that the wake phrase is experimental, and a microphone indicator shows while it listens.
clause: F-VOICE-46.label
step: Say the wake phrase clearly, about one metre from the microphone.
expect: The assistant answers with its listening sound within two seconds.
clause: F-VOICE-46.hear
step: Talk normally for one minute without the phrase (read a paragraph of any text).
expect: The assistant does not wake by itself more than once.
clause: F-VOICE-46.false
step: Open the Browser tile on a page that asks for the microphone and say the phrase.
expect: The assistant still hears the phrase, or the page says why it cannot.
clause: F-VOICE-60.browser
step: Switch the wake phrase off again.
expect: The microphone indicator disappears and saying the phrase does nothing.
clause: F-VOICE-46.off
